             This rule applies to packets with the specified TOS bits set.
             _s_t_r_i_n_g may be one of ccrriittiiccaall, iinneettccoonnttrrooll, lloowwddeellaayy, nneettccoonnttrrooll,
             tthhrroouugghhppuutt, rreelliiaabbiilliittyy, or one of the DiffServ Code Points: eeff,
             aaff1111 ... aaff4433, ccss00 ... ccss77; _n_u_m_b_e_r may be either a hex or decimal
             number.

